# Real student roster — never commit actual student IDs. It's fetched at
# runtime (not bundled), so a missing file here just falls back to "accept
# any ID" rather than breaking the build. Create it locally before
# deploying with a real roster: {"ids": ["s1234567", ...]}
public/roster.json
